  m_text: 'Ensure there is a continuous road path between the two nodes you want
    to connect.



    Click and hold on the source node.



    While holding, drag
    the mouse along the road tiles toward the target node.

    Move slowly across
    the road, tile by tile.



    When you are on a road tile next to the target
    node, drag into the target node and release.



    The connection is created
    and connection mode ends.



    Hover a node to check its connections and confirm
    resources will travel where you expect.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6640d7c940fd1d149bdc227d0274b490, type: 2}
