  m_text: 'Click the Build button to enter build mode.



    Select a node type
    and click on valid tiles to place it.



    Select Road to place road tiles
    that connect your nodes.



    Hold Shift while placing to place multiple of
    the same thing in a row.



    When placing roads, you can hold the mouse button
    to continuously extend a road.



    Use nodes that produce the resources shown
    in the level requirements, and place enough roads to connect them all the way
    to the Gate of Tribute.



'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6640d7c940fd1d149bdc227d0274b490, type: 2}
