  m_text: "Check the Gate of Tribute in the top\u2011right requirements panel (or
    by hovering over the Gate) to see exactly which resources, and how many, are
    needed.\r\n\r\nBuild the required producer nodes, support nodes, and roads.\r\n\r\nCreate
    connections so resources can flow from their sources, through your network, into
    the Gate.\r\n\r\nWhen the Gate receives all required resources, the level is
    completed and you advance."
