  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Top right \u2013 Level Requirements\r\nShows what this level needs to
    complete. Hover over each icon or the Gate to see its detailed requirements.\r\n\r\nBottom
    right \u2013 Build & Delete\r\n\r\nBuild button: Enter build mode to place nodes
    and roads.\r\n\r\nDelete button: Remove existing nodes and roads.\r\n\r\nBottom
    left \u2013 Node Info\r\nWhen your mouse is over a node in the world, or over
    that node\u2019s button in the Build menu, this panel shows:\r\n\r\nWhat the
    node produces.\r\n\r\nWhat the node requires (inputs).\r\n\r\nAny other key info
    about that node.\r\n\r\nWhen you hover over a building, you also see what it
    is connected to, helping you debug your network."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6640d7c940fd1d149bdc227d0274b490, type: 2}
